{
  "description": "What a reader keeps of a manifest's doors_elsewhere: each case's manifest gives kept. Every entry is checked alone and dropped alone: an item type of the five, not one the manifest lists in item_types and not one an entry kept before it names; a URL kept as written, https, at most 2048 characters, with no user or password, on a host of two labels or more whose last label starts with a letter. Since 0.9.0 an entry's platform is kept when vocab/door-platforms.json knows the token, the platform takes that kind and the URL is the business's own page there (or the platform serves pages on the business's own domain); otherwise the platform alone is dropped. detect gives, for a URL and a kind, the platform doorPlatformOf finds (null for none) and the name doorPlace gives the door; clean gives the tracking and affiliate parameters doorTrackingParams finds and the URL cleanDoorUrl leaves. Read by packages/core/test/doors-elsewhere.test.ts and packages/spec/test/door-platforms.test.ts.",
